 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 4.771,
   "text": "In the temple, the Pharisees tried to trap Jesus with a question.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 5.071,
   "end": 8.522,
   "text": "Teacher, is it right to pay taxes to Caesar, or not?",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 8.922,
   "end": 12.235,
   "text": "Bring me a coin. Whose face is this? And whose name?",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 12.635,
   "end": 13.438,
   "text": "Caesar's.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 13.838,
   "end": 18.483,
   "text": "Then give back to Caesar what is Caesar's, and to God what is God's.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 19.183,
   "end": 24.421,
   "text": "Then a teacher of the law asked him: Which commandment is the most important?",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 24.821,
   "end": 32.022,
   "text": "Love the Lord your God with all your heart, with all your soul, with all your mind, and with all your strength.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 32.522,
   "end": 39.04,
   "text": "The second is this: Love your neighbour as yourself. There is no commandment greater than these.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 39.74,
   "end": 46.387,
   "text": "Jesus sat near the temple offering box, and watched. Many rich people threw in large amounts.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 46.687,
   "end": 50.761,
   "text": "Then a poor widow came, and put in two very small coins.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 51.361,
   "end": 61.462,
   "text": "Truly, this poor widow has put in more than all the others. They gave out of their wealth. But she, out of her poverty, gave everything she had.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 62.262,
   "end": 65.764,
   "text": "As they were leaving the temple, one of his disciples said:",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 65.964,
   "end": 68.964,
   "text": "Teacher, look! What massive stones! What beautiful buildings!",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 69.364,
   "end": 74.188,
   "text": "Not one stone here will be left on another. Every one will be thrown down.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 74.788,
   "end": 79.677,
   "text": "Heaven and earth will pass away, but my words will never pass away.",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 80.277,
   "end": 83.965,
   "text": "No one knows the day or the hour. So keep watch!",
   "tempter": false
  },
  {
   "start": 84.865,
   "end": 88.368,
   "text": "Follow for part seventeen.",
   "tempter": false
  }
 ]
}